Choose between hybrid KV group layouts by their allocator capacity cost rather
than by their shape alone.

Materialize exactly the groups the allocator will use: merge() has to run on
each real strided subset, not once on a representative spec that stands in for
the whole bucket, or the cost compared is not the cost paid.

